[26.403445, "o", "\u001b[1mdiff --git a/README.md b/README.md\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1mindex 14617f2..838ca74 100644\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1m--- a/README.md\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1m+++ b/README.md\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[36m@@ -10,6 +10,8 @@\u001b[m \u001b[mSee it happen — a commit moves the card (30 s, real CLI):\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[m\r\n ![zuuna: a commit moves the card](demo/zuuna-demo.gif)\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mThe same loop, run by an agent: [demo/agent-run.gif](demo/agent-run.gif) records a ZCode (GLM) agent session — MCP tools read the work, the agent opens the PR, and the merge itself closes card CLI-3 on the public demo board at [app.zuuna.de/demo](https://app.zuuna.de/demo).\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\r\n ---\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[m\r\n ## Quickstart: from nothing to a moved card\u001b[m\r\n"]
